{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ is not a valid address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ ist keine gültige Adresse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is not a wave-mesh control server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ ist kein wave-mesh-Control-Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %lld ms": {
      "comment": "Path of a peer: how it is reached (\"relay\" or an address) and its round-trip time.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · %lld ms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add another wave": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weiteren Wave hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a restart or a network change the tunnel comes back by itself. iOS runs one VPN at a time: switch this off if you also use another one and want to choose each time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach einem Neustart oder Netzwechsel kommt der Tunnel von selbst wieder. iOS lässt nur ein VPN gleichzeitig zu: schalte das aus, wenn du auch ein anderes nutzt und jedes Mal selbst wählen willst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another VPN is connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein anderes VPN ist verbunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abbrechen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leeren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbinden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatisch verbinden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect wave-mesh": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "wave-mesh verbinden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting to %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbinde mit %@ …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weiter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Control server, e.g. wave.example.com": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Control-Server, z. B. wave.example.com"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy address": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adresse kopieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy name": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name kopieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device name": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gerätename"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnect": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trennen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dismiss": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ausblenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the next step iOS asks whether wave-mesh may add a VPN configuration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im nächsten Schritt fragt iOS, ob wave-mesh eine VPN-Konfiguration hinzufügen darf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the next wave you join, this device is called %@. A wave it is already in keeps the name it got there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im nächsten Wave, dem du beitrittst, heißt dieses Gerät %@. In einem Wave, in dem es schon ist, behält es seinen bisherigen Namen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS did not apply the tunnel settings in time": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS hat die Tunnel-Einstellungen nicht rechtzeitig übernommen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS runs one VPN at a time. Connecting wave-mesh disconnects the other one, for example Tailscale.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS lässt nur ein VPN gleichzeitig zu. Verbindest du wave-mesh, wird das andere getrennt, zum Beispiel Tailscale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join a wave": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einem Wave beitreten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last handshake %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Letzter Handshake %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave %@?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ verlassen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave this wave": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diesen Wave verlassen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Protokoll"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log in": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anmelden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log in again": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erneut anmelden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "no control connection; peers will stop being updated": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "keine Verbindung zum Control-Server; die Peers werden nicht mehr aktualisiert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "no fixed path": {
      "comment": "No confirmed path yet; packets still flow to every known candidate.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "kein fester Pfad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No server answers at %@. Check the address and this device's connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unter %@ antwortet kein Server. Prüf die Adresse und die Verbindung dieses Geräts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No wave-mesh control server answers at %@; its certificate belongs to another service. Enter the address of your control server, not the domain of your wave.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unter %@ antwortet kein wave-mesh-Control-Server; das Zertifikat gehört zu einem anderen Dienst. Gib die Adresse deines Control-Servers ein, nicht die Domain deines Waves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "offline": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "offline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the approval page again": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bestätigungsseite erneut öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the web interface": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weboberfläche öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paused. This device stays in the wave and can switch it back on without a new approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pausiert. Dieses Gerät bleibt im Wave und kann ihn ohne neue Bestätigung wieder einschalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktualisieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "relay": {
      "comment": "A peer reached through the relay server rather than directly.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relay"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Teilen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address %@ does not exist. Check how your control server's address is spelled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Adresse %@ gibt es nicht. Prüf die Schreibweise der Adresse deines Control-Servers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app sends no data to Moellenbeck Digital. It contains no analytics and no advertising, and no data is sold or passed on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die App sendet keine Daten an Moellenbeck Digital. Sie enthält keine Analyse und keine Werbung, und es werden keine Daten verkauft oder weitergegeben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The control server sent a network map that does not carry its signature. Nothing in it was used; the wave keeps the last good one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Control-Server hat eine Netzkarte geschickt, die seine Signatur nicht trägt. Nichts davon wurde übernommen; der Wave behält die letzte gültige."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The log is empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Protokoll ist leer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The log stays on this device until you share it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Protokoll bleibt auf diesem Gerät, bis du es teilst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tunnel did not start. The log says more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Tunnel ist nicht gestartet. Mehr steht im Protokoll."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tunnel did not start: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Tunnel ist nicht gestartet: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the tunnel interface has no descriptor; the extension cannot carry traffic": {
      "comment": "Tunnel extension: shown by iOS when the tunnel fails to start.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "das Tunnel-Interface hat keinen Deskriptor; die Extension kann keinen Verkehr tragen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tunnel is off. Nothing in your waves is reachable from this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Tunnel ist aus. Von diesem Gerät aus ist in deinen Waves nichts erreichbar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tunnel stopped before the login finished.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Tunnel wurde beendet, bevor die Anmeldung fertig war."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The VPN configuration is not set up yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die VPN-Konfiguration ist noch nicht eingerichtet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the wave core did not start": {
      "comment": "Tunnel extension: shown by iOS when the tunnel fails to start.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "der wave-Kern ist nicht gestartet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Gerät"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device is in no wave yet. Enter the address of your control server to join one; the tunnel starts by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Gerät ist noch in keinem Wave. Gib die Adresse deines Control-Servers ein, um beizutreten; der Tunnel startet von selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device leaves the wave and forgets its keys. Joining again needs a new approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Gerät verlässt den Wave und vergisst seine Schlüssel. Erneut beitreten braucht eine neue Bestätigung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device was removed from the wave. Log in again to come back; it needs a new approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Gerät wurde aus dem Wave entfernt. Melde dich erneut an, um zurückzukommen; das braucht eine neue Bestätigung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This wave did not come up: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Wave ist nicht hochgekommen: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To join a wave, the app sends the control server you enter this device's name, its public keys and the network addresses it can be reached at. Neither the control server nor the relay can read your traffic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um einem Wave beizutreten, sendet die App an den Control-Server, den du angibst, den Namen dieses Geräts, seine öffentlichen Schlüssel und die Netzwerkadressen, unter denen es erreichbar ist. Weder der Control-Server noch das Relay können deinen Verkehr lesen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Traffic between your devices runs encrypted with WireGuard, directly from device to device. Where no direct path is possible, it runs encrypted through a relay of your wave.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Verkehr zwischen deinen Geräten läuft verschlüsselt mit WireGuard, direkt von Gerät zu Gerät. Wo kein direkter Weg möglich ist, läuft er verschlüsselt über ein Relay deines Waves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval in the browser…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Warte auf die Bestätigung im Browser …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "wave-mesh sets up a VPN on this device that connects it with the other devices in your wave.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "wave-mesh richtet auf diesem Gerät ein VPN ein, das es mit den anderen Geräten deines Waves verbindet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it connects": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was verbunden wird"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What we do not do": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was wir nicht tun"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your control server learns": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was dein Control-Server erfährt"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
